**Key principle:** everything is addressed by a **character offset inside the chapter's canonical text** (the same text produced by your extraction pipeline, Section 41). Page numbers are *derived* from layout and change with font size; offsets never do. Position, bookmarks, highlights, TTS word timings and AI citations all use the same offsets, which is what keeps the features consistent with each other.

