## 3. Data model

### 3.1 Anchor (shared by annotations, bookmarks, position) [A]

```ts
export interface Anchor {
  chapterId: string;
  start: number;        // char offset in chapter canonical text (inclusive)
  end: number;          // exclusive; for a point (bookmark/position) end === start
  exact?: string;       // selected text (annotations only)
  prefix?: string;      // 32 chars before — used to re-anchor if text is re-extracted
  suffix?: string;      // 32 chars after
}
```

